/-!
# GMCExplicitDelta

Explicit disorder thresholds for the cutoff-uniform coarse-graining cascade of the log-correlated
(Gaussian multiplicative chaos) model. `import GMCExplicitDelta` loads the main theorems
`GMCExplicitDelta.explicit_cascade_two`, `explicit_cascade_three` and `explicit_cascade_four`
(`GMCExplicitDelta/Statements/`), and the three moment bounds for the source field used in their proofs.
